# Verification Plan for Authenticator Functions

## Overview

This document describes the verification plan for the functions and constants
listed in [`doc/truong/authenticator_functions.txt`](../truong/authenticator_functions.txt), which
enumerates all fully qualified function and constant names from
`src/authenticator.rs` and `src/authenticator/serialize.rs` (Rust source). These are extracted into
`Spqr/Code/Funs.lean` (Lean 4 / Aeneas extraction).

All extractable functions are configured via
[`aeneas-config.yml`](../../aeneas-config.yml). Functions not appearing in
that configuration (e.g. `#[cfg(test)]` items) are not extracted and therefore
cannot be verified in the current framework.

